            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The disclosure relates to a hinge assembly and an electronic device. The hinge assembly includes a fixed supporting piece); a rotating assembly, movably connected with the fixed supporting piece and the rotating assembly comprising a base body and a second pull rod (24), wherein one end of the second pull rod (24) is movably connected with the base body, and the other end is rotationally connected with the fixed supporting piece; wherein the second pull rod (24) comprises a movable portion (241), the base body comprises a first arc-shaped track (224), the movable portion (241) comprises an arc-shaped movable portion, the arc-shaped movable portion extends into the first arc-shaped track (224), and the fixed supporting piece is configured to gradually move away from or get close to the base body when the movable portion (241) moves along the first arc-shaped track (224).</p>
            </abstract>
